<!--
  Bill of materials for the Rimfrost release rimfrost-1_2.

  Contains every Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-* repository that has the git tag
  rimfrost-1_2 and publishes a Maven artifact. The poms in those repositories
  declare *-SNAPSHOT versions, so each version here is the release tag that
  rimfrost-1_2 points at (the commits in between only update CHANGELOG.md).
  rimfrost-framework-regel-oul-asyncapi has no 0.0.2 git tag; its version is
  taken from gradle.properties.

  Tagged rimfrost-1_2 but not included, since they publish no Maven artifact:
    rimfrost-kubernetes                            -        (Kubernetes manifests and smoketest, no release tag)
    rimfrost-portal-admin-fe                       0.0.2    (npm frontend, not a Maven artifact)
    rimfrost-portal-handlaggare                    0.4.0    (npm frontend, not a Maven artifact)
    rimfrost-regel-bekraftabeslut-fe               0.0.4    (npm frontend, not a Maven artifact)
    rimfrost-regel-rtf-manuell-fe                  0.0.4    (npm frontend, not a Maven artifact)
    rimfrost-regel-rtf-manuell-komplettering-fe    0.0.1    (npm frontend, not a Maven artifact)
    rimfrost-template-micro-fe                     2.0.1    (npm frontend, not a Maven artifact)
-->
